  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello,\n\nI think it would be interesting to separate the language of the UI and tooltips in order to, for example, keep the UI in English for users accustomed to these settings, but have the tooltips in their language to better understand certain settings when needed.\n\nLike Blender, for example.\n\nThank you!\n\nLusiiky",
